TAILED BEAST CAPTURE ORDER - LEADER'S DIRECTIVE

The nine beasts are to be sealed into the Gedo Statue in the sequence set below.
The order prioritises accessible hosts first and the most heavily defended last,
building the Statue's power before we face the guarded jinchuriki.

1. One-Tail (Shukaku) - Sand - COMPLETE
2. Two-Tails (Matatabi) - Cloud - COMPLETE
3. Three-Tails (Isobu) - free beast, reacquire
4. Four-Tails (Son Goku) - Rock host - COMPLETE
5. Five-Tails (Kokuo) - Rock host - COMPLETE
6. Six-Tails (Saiken) - in pursuit
7. Seven-Tails (Chomei) - Waterfall - COMPLETE
8. Eight-Tails (Gyuki) - Cloud - HOLD, most dangerous
9. Nine-Tails (Kurama) - Leaf - HOLD FOR LAST

The Statue is incomplete until all nine eyes open. Do not break sequence.
